/**
 * FACILITY ICONS — one stroke set covering the whole infrastructure inventory.
 *
 * Inline for the same reason as SafetyIcon: they must inherit `currentColor` so
 * a single icon reads correctly on the ivory group bands, the sand explorer and
 * the ink CTA without a second asset per surface. Drawn on a 24-grid at 1.5
 * stroke to match the rest of the site's line work.
 *
 * Unknown names fall back to a dot rather than throwing, so a typo in the data
 * file degrades to a neutral mark instead of a blank page.
 */
